		<member kind="method" name="create">
			<signature>static func create( record_namespace: String, record_key: String, local_data: Dictionary, remote_data: Dictionary, options: Dictionary = {} ) -&gt; GFStorageConflictReport:</signature>
			<description>创建冻结报告；无效身份、选项或载荷返回 null。</description>
			<tags>
				<tag name="api">public</tag>
				<tag name="param">record_namespace: 记录命名空间。</tag>
				<tag name="param">record_key: 记录键。</tag>
				<tag name="param">local_data: 本地完整候选。</tag>
				<tag name="param">remote_data: 已观察的远端完整候选。</tag>
				<tag name="param">options: revision 与存在性声明。</tag>
				<tag name="return">隔离报告或 null；完整报告限深度64、300000节点、64MiB规范字节。</tag>
				<tag name="schema">local_data: Dictionary of finite native data; no objects or cycles.</tag>
				<tag name="schema">remote_data: Same native contract; empty when remote_exists=false.</tag>
				<tag name="schema">options: Closed Dictionary with expected_revision:String (default empty), actual_revision:String (default empty), remote_exists:bool (default true). Empty revisions are allowed for plain Backend transfers.</tag>
				<tag name="since">unreleased</tag>
			</tags>
		</member>
